#: 
msgid "Fallback logo URL for email templates, used only when no church logo has been uploaded on the Church Information page. The application's own pages ignore this setting and always use the uploaded logo or the default ChurchCRM logo. Must be an absolute http(s) URL. For best rendering across email clients, use a wide banner image at roughly a 3.5:1 aspect ratio (for example 350×100 px), PNG or JPG, served over HTTPS. Leave blank or enter an invalid value to fall back to the default ChurchCRM logo."
